        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad2dbcadf9dec36f828084b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员～！\r\n我们今天要做什么训练啊？\r\n我随时都能紧急起飞哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37d0fcec22a25d961ac69be4a038aab7ff106e581d6c7a1f5ba1d7c1a87305ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd025ee04a9e588ec4f4be61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧，训练员！\r\n今天也要Take Off去寻找令人期待、\r\n闪闪发亮的事情哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd85db3c300b706d21409af0434a2236b8df6b2cf3682d88b752a8d827c7c28b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03dd00d7fe7805e8965430bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你──好──☆\r\n晚上会让人感觉心跳加快呢！\r\n因为是属于大人的时间吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0207b55401cf1fc32afb6f4fed129c5cc7132fa61f2180d274e048a1083c664",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:920eecf0db2456c364121350",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊……训练员……\r\n忙到这么晚真是辛苦了～\r\nMaya啊……好像已经想睡觉了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba103a18529fef1438bc42eef0a7429150a3f098b6d45a4115d05bc5bacb94ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d84bf4fd14faa4cf7ef5f496",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天的约会就决定是散步了！\r\n一定会充满期待，非常开心的！\r\n我们要一起去很多地方哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "282dea96e2e45c827668c23d0eed01fa491799338e807f2de17c838069bad207",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c61d92eaae6e38466b811c67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晒太阳的痕迹会让人觉得很刺激啊？\r\n那Maya要晒很多太阳！\r\n变成充满刺激的大人～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e998d11a28df61431e27c098e141985e0c1b8a6835cca27eddd07dc1b2d064f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d10f6b3317ce4ea1bfb327ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天可以尝试很多的穿搭呢！\r\n要不要尝试成熟的风格\r\n来耀眼一下呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "78913b265f372eee4b868453b26c4cd6251a8aa5e007dee10dfa6de5c31c17e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a654b3f2da0cce6b0f04128",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～好冷好冷～！\r\n喂喂，你有哪边口袋是空着的吗？\r\n可不可以让Maya借放一下手～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6f8f75c7e52d55758eb7db26a2d43acb0862f5d29054e2a62ff1a56668b2747",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:436d25d7cda49d5151cd76f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "叮当叮当──♪\r\nMaya来叫你起床咯～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8304011760a6de56021477f4b6eb714c2ca772f1d85a8d65c86c95a254249bfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c24d57dafef2ea41764d5159",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！诶嘿嘿～\r\n因为一早就想让训练员看到，\r\n所以就飞奔过来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f78576f5b48925d350301c64f34385ebf0fd18dc625cbe3bbccba77f8bfbfdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8ae1d7b5c95e159cb46e080",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐呐！要来做训练吗？\r\nMaya随时都能跟你走哦☆\r\n走向幸福长久的未来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f12436a7acc3717da21579ba42c02446831df9fac6cc07e4fad29124fcd07e1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b6c6a26458ff19230504adf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锁定目标☆\r\n用训练员的笑容补充下午的动力～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f03a94d1a12ecefd68fc8454eb612c491306e3cd6a2c6701d66d5a1ab6e3cdda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f87a24b8716dbdf898ae187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了！工作结束后要吃饭吗？\r\n还是洗澡？或者是……\r\n办一场睡衣派对！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "424248b1fe712362fadc74988d3977d2358020bed41f4d73893ff8a2b4ea7aa2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa776f49723f51c2cee4c1fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也在熬夜吗？\r\n好巧哦☆Maya也是耶！\r\n我们之间可能真的有一条红线呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f102e35ecaf9dead7579ca325399c56ce47ceb278ff8c9b6f2ace05025e274a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d7399edcd4a02e4328ea05b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听我说听我说！\r\n我被新生误以为是模特儿了喔☆\r\n羞羞～",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd3125b030519a4943f1f41837d722a29d0c9cb983eb16f7b41acbe406229277",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fcf83480767fdece141b3c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐呐！我们去海边吧！\r\n当作是海岛蜜月的提前彩排☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bfc249507c4835b0e6c888e63ca61cadd02269625db11a50177f796691418eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:661eb13b628e69d76cb4f52a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出一个谜题！\r\n像花一样可爱却不会凋零枯萎，\r\n这样的赛马娘是谁？……就是Maya☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "449c9fdaf8c6f51d98f6c3fae6ec2c58e8a387d88eddd3f484162d92ddb5e581",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcda0ab21e0a244e7f8b5954",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽说我脚这样会冷，\r\n就给了我一个暖暖包诶♪\r\n感觉好像我的妈妈哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e55e1187fc2bc9b4bf6fd9197ea6e9580cc19c3c7dac8e10749702e668d8acf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:befac351e1222a78f0b9505a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa3b66a5ebbb1720ae0a480f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7f3a319f4a662bcd5c37068",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上猫咪套装后从早上开始就\r\n充满了干劲！要是夸夸我的话……\r\n会更上一层楼的哦♡呐~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f32edaf00ae65849ce1010307287674310a5c14f97057c45e117f4f2bb55a7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f94fb22c77e5c9262b1f0151",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Good monrnning，训练员！\r\n然・后・是……are you ready？\r\n今天也要喵喵地take off！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a412848df37f8781f824fc3961e9205b03b3ad01faf34af2bc6e37208676af19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f0c54a91dacf6143503726e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，今天要做什么呢？\r\n比赛？训练？？还是说~……\r\n悠闲地晒太阳喵？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d6655365187912cfc7d530ec38a4434a6879f67da40c16b7768166f69e68db9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fed0e4df22f1b97db1645567",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "找到了找到了，训练员！\r\nMaya喵来给你送上幸福♪\r\n就像福来前辈的招财猫那样☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "01744aed4fcfac7355e4015d5e69dfae7bcd06b446dbb58b3610fd01fb83d9f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d3fcd438da0417182d955ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "月夜下的特蕾森学园里出现的是……\r\n寻找欢欣雀跃的黑猫・Maya！\r\n欸嘿嘿，我要独占夜晚的赛场～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3820c88ab5c46f2e9b27ff3d09d15d83cfd3ee7d668035eb31294d8ba6e189b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dae2bebf674d0fad5ad03aad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也在夜晚散步吗？\r\n那我们就这么找个长椅坐下来，\r\n像大人一样分享耳机吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "476445b47eda5989252afe14e688d3c68aaaee79df5372dec63525ef88d7a335",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef60593ecd6a4f453b78f3fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，你去赏花了吗？\r\n顺便一说，Maya~……\r\n无论何时都是最佳观赏期哦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb83880e91c31cad83efeaeb89987909bd3ea9e9347751e59e13dd42900f1d65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aeb8a86581bcab80aa32e59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Enjoy summer☆约会计划，\r\n很让人烦恼呢！海滩就很不错，\r\n夏季庆典也很热闹♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7905eb24038acf08076b5bbae04a78f896d69a298c734e11cbf8e77feed32422",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b9293176117e51ba6ef6169",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "菜单上的菜全~都很好吃！\r\n有着秋天的味道……很让人着迷♡\r\n每天在食堂都很『Nyavelous☆』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05e88d945aab0a7ae08ee9d9b0b874a4ce5fc2f04b21d63453724c60f52b09af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59d090a2563c6f27dbbc666e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐！在训练员室放个暖脚器吧！\r\n人家想一起变得圆滚滚~……\r\n然后办个橘子派对啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "72a5302be32ed0551f9b2bef6b75508462db8484d8d76aad9b78c98dcebed377",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:188962d01d153d200cecc40d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a73fb85d80455fb3c8f0733",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Marvelous！\r\n诶嘿♪我在学Mabe亲啦！\r\n跟她一起玩就记住了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8497343ff230016aa525f4521a8cd32617547621a9a3e289ffee32f6cb70fabd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
